This software calls into third-party packages at runtime (ComfyUI-SAM3DBody,
which in turn depends on Meta's SAM 3D Body model weights, and Kijai's
ComfyUI-WanAnimatePreprocess). Those are separate projects under their own
licenses — this MIT license covers only the code in this repository, not
the third-party packages it depends on. In particular, Meta's SAM 3D Body
weights are governed by Meta's own SAM License, not by this file; installing
and using those weights means accepting Meta's license terms separately.
